{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794570875757,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4c270690012omCZe1OnREQ8k","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","messageID":"msg_1d4c25564001InYkycmOLIw7u1","type":"tool","id":"call_7a919a00517e4e53838557d2","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research; grep -rn \"deliveryUnknown\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build --include=*.md | head -10"},"output":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-report.md:261:- Adjustment: this is the rule the packet specified. Phase 013 task T022 says \"add 1 to a new `offerReached` when `result.offered` and `result.briefDelivered !== false`\". SC-002 pins OpenCode at `offerReached` 3 with `deliveryUnknown` 24. The code is right. The README line at `:111` (\"offers on a turn whose brief arrived\") is wrong.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-report-pass-1.md:261:- Adjustment: this is the rule the packet specified. Phase 013 task T022 says \"add 1 to a new `offerReached` when `result.offered` and `result.briefDelivered !== false`\". SC-002 pins OpenCode at `offerReached` 3 with `deliveryUnknown` 24. The code is right. The README line at `:111` (\"offers on a turn whose brief arrived\") is wrong.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin/containment/quarantine/1/content/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3/research.md:125:3. **One unknown is invisible.** `deliveryUnknown` counts inside `addScored`, so the DSH row that cannot be scored contributes nothing and DSH prints 0 unknown while its log holds one.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin/containment/quarantine/1/content/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3/research.md:159:| 5 | Count `deliveryUnknown` on run lines, not only scored rows | `score-command-transcripts.mjs:1300` | DSH prints `delivery unknown 1` where it prints 0; the count stops depending on scorability | Fixture: an unscored line with `briefDelivered: 'unknown'` increments the counter | None |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin/containment/quarantine/1/content/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3/iterations/iteration-003.md:18:2. **The new summary counters read the field they were added for.** OpenCode prints `delivery unknown 24`, Codex prints `offer reached 0`, and the other four print `offer reached 3`; `offer field absent` is 0 on all six where the pre-arm read 24. So the rename from `offerUnknown` to `offerFieldAbsent` and the new `deliveryUnknown` are live, not decorative. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1293] [scorer output 2026-11-13]\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin/containment/quarantine/1/content/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3/iterations/iteration-003.md:24:5. **One unknown is invisible in the summary because the same row cannot be scored.** DSH's single `unknown` belongs to `cmd-deep-review-plain-tune-01`, whose locator has no `sessionId`; the scorer records it `locator_unavailable`. `deliveryUnknown` is counted inside `addScored`, so a row that never scores contributes no `delivery unknown`. DSH therefore prints `delivery unknown 0` while its log holds one. The denominator for delivery unknown is scored rows, not run lines. [SOURCE: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/runs-post-attributed.jsonl] [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1300]\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin/containment/quarantine/1/content/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3/iterations/iteration-004.md:28:| 4 | Count `deliveryUnknown` on run lines, not only on scored rows | `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1300` | DSH prints `delivery unknown 1` where it prints 0 today; the count stops depending on scorability | Fixture: an unscored line with `briefDelivered: 'unknown'` increments the counter | None |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install/containment/quarantine/1/content/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3/iterations/iteration-003.md:18:2. **The new summary counters read the field they were added for.** OpenCode prints `delivery unknown 24`, Codex prints `offer reached 0`, and the other four print `offer reached 3`; `offer field absent` is 0 on all six where the pre-arm read 24. So the rename from `offerUnknown` to `offerFieldAbsent` and the new `deliveryUnknown` are live, not decorative. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1293] [scorer output 2026-11-13]\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing