9-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3/iterations/iteration-003.md:18:2. **The new summary counters read the field they were added for.** OpenCode prints `delivery unknown 24`, Codex prints `offer reached 0`, and the other four print `offer reached 3`; `offer field absent` is 0 on all six where the pre-arm read 24. So the rename from `offerUnknown` to `offerFieldAbsent` and the new `deliveryUnknown` are live, not decorative. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1293] [scorer output 2026-11-13]\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin/containment/quarantine/1/content/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3/iterations/iteration-003.md:24:5. **One unknown is invisible in the summary because the same row cannot be scored.** DSH's single `unknown` belongs to `cmd-deep-review-plain-tune-01`, whose locator has no `sessionId`; the scorer records it `locator_unavailable`. `deliveryUnknown` is counted inside `addScored`, so a row that never scores contributes no `delivery unknown`. DSH therefore prints `delivery unknown 0` while its log holds one. The denominator for delivery unknown is scored rows, not run lines. [SOURCE: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/runs-post-attributed.jsonl] [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1300]\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin/containment/quarantine/1/content/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3/iterations/iteration-004.md:28:| 4 | Count `deli