{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794571203083,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4c731e7001K54Qj9Bu4vqt6s","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","messageID":"msg_1d4c6ec1a001b5mqGrynAxV4MK","type":"tool","id":"call_e390438447d94974996e6f8f","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner-2 Lineage\n\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\n\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder target)\n- Fan-out lineage: `accuracy-runner-2` (artifact dir `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2`); pass-two area is `accuracy-runner`\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n- Stop conditions: legal convergence at `convergenceThreshold=0.10`, or `maxIterations=7`, whichever comes first\n- Success criteria: every pass-one finding in the area re-verified; every file marked `yes` in `review-scope-2.txt` reviewed line by line; every area file covered at least once; findings carry `file:line` and a concrete input; holdout hygiene verified by counts only\n- Review focus (operator bound): pass-two code review of command surfacing. Re-verify each pass-one fix in the area, review every file changed since pass one line by line for a defect the fix introduced, then look for new defects. Check behaviour on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin and dsh; safety of offering a mutating command; holdout hygiene; docs that disagree with code.\n- Resource map: `resource-map.md` not present; skipping coverage gate\n- Baseline: pass one is closed at `review/review-report-pass-1.md`; its fixes landed in `b3b5ae8314` and `3b48f0e5f1`\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nCommand surfacing behaviour for the routed skill/command advisor, restricted to the `accuracy-runner` area: the routing-accuracy measurement harness (`runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/`), the prompt corpora and their committed baselines, the cost-measurement benches, the transcript/offer tests, the legacy fidelity tests and the manual-testing playbook that documents how to run them.\n\n---\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not reviewing `scorer-attach`, `render-hooks-plugin` or `doctor-install` area files except as read-only context when a cross-area contract is required\n- Not fixing anything: the review is observation-only\n- Not reading or printing holdout prompt text; holdout coverage is counts-only\n- Not re-reporting a pass-one finding whose fix holds, the deferred items in report section 8, `R4-P2-003`, or the refuted finding\n- Not running repo tooling that writes outside the lineage; runners are audited by reading, and only the single-file vitest commands the dispatch allows were run\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Legal convergence (all dimensions covered plus stabilization) at or below `convergenceThreshold`\n- `maxIterations=7` reached (`stopReason: maxIterationsReached`)\n- Any active P0 blocks a PASS verdict but does not stop iteration dispatch by itself; the P0 override keeps `newFindingsRatio >= 0.50`\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n- [Approach]: [Why it worked] (iteration N)\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n- [Approach]: [Why it failed] (iteration N)\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n[Review angles investigated and definitively eliminated]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: pass-one fix replay across the accuracy-runner area, then the changed measurement code\n- Reason: pass two opens by proving each closed fix holds before reviewing the changed files line by line\n- Rotation status: D1 first\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: none\n- Required evidence: the committed fix at its cited line, plus a failing input if the fix does not hold\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: the 31 `accuracy-runner` files in `review-scope-2.txt` (routing-accuracy runners/corpora, cost measurements, transcript/offer tests, legacy fidelity tests, the manual-testing playbook), plus shared docs that describe them.\n- Behaviour claims to verify: routed command surfacing is cross-runtime correct (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh); a mutating command is never offered unsafely; holdout rows are never read by tune/fix/report paths; docs match runner behaviour; pass-one fixes hold.\n- Reuse and conventions: append-gateway state recording, P0/P1/P2 severity ladder, three-artifact iteration contract, pass-one report as the fix baseline.\n- Review risks and gaps: holdout prompt text is out of read scope (counts only); the worktree is dirty from concurrent lineages, so a live behaviour arm would refuse with `worktree_dirty` and runners are audited by reading; the coverage graph is unavailable, so search is lexical and direct-read.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | [pending] | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | [pending] | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | [pending] | - | - |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | [pending] | - | - |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | [pending] | - | - |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | [pending] | - | - |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| [accuracy-runner scope files] | - | - | - | pending |\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 7\n- Convergence threshold: 0.10\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-accuracy-runner-2-1794570021136-noekp0, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-13T11:48:49Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner-2 Lineage\\n\\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\\n\\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder target)\\n- Fan-out lineage: `accuracy-runner-2` (artifact dir `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2`); pass-two area is `accuracy-runner`\\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\\n- Stop conditions: legal convergence at `convergenceThreshold=0.10`, or `maxIterations=7`, whichever comes first\\n- Success criteria: every pass-one finding in the area re-verified; every file marked `yes` in `review-scope-2.txt` reviewed line by line; every area file covered at least once; findings carry `file:line` and a concrete input; holdout hygiene verified by counts only\\n- Review focus (operator bound): pass-two code review of command surfacing. Re-verify each pass-one fix in the area, review every file changed since pass one line by line for a defect the fix introduced, then look for new defects. Check behaviour on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin and dsh; safety of offering a mutating command; holdout hygiene; docs that disagree with code.\\n- Resource map: `resource-map.md` not present; skipping coverage gate\\n- Baseline: pass one is closed at `review/review-report-pass-1.md`; its fixes landed in `b3b5ae8314` and `3b48f0e5f1`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nCommand surfacing behaviour for the routed skill/command advisor, restricted to the `accuracy-runner` area: the routing-accuracy measurement harness (`runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/`), the prompt corpora and their committed baselines, the cost-measurement benches, the transcript/offer tests, the legacy fidelity tests and the manual-testing playbook that documents how to run them.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Not reviewing `scorer-attach`, `render-hooks-plugin` or `doctor-install` area files except as read-only context when a cross-area contract is required\\n- Not fixing anything: the review is observation-only\\n- Not reading or printing holdout prompt text; holdout coverage is counts-only\\n- Not re-reporting a pass-one finding whose fix holds, the deferred items in report section 8, `R4-P2-003`, or the refuted finding\\n- Not running repo tooling that writes outside the lineage; runners are audited by reading, and only the single-file vitest commands the dispatch allows were run\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Legal convergence (all dimensions covered plus stabilization) at or below `convergenceThreshold`\\n- `maxIterations=7` reached (`stopReason: maxIterationsReached`)\\n- Any active P0 blocks a PASS verdict but does not stop iteration dispatch by itself; the P0 override keeps `newFindingsRatio >= 0.50`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n- [Approach]: [Why it worked] (iteration N)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n- [Approach]: [Why it failed] (iteration N)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n[Review angles investigated and definitively eliminated]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Dimension: correctness\\n- Focus area: pass-one fix replay across the accuracy-runner area, then the changed measurement code\\n- Reason: pass two opens by proving each closed fix holds before reviewing the changed files line by line\\n- Rotation status: D1 first\\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: none\\n- Required evidence: the committed fix at its cited line, plus a failing input if the fix does not hold\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: the 31 `accuracy-runner` files in `review-scope-2.txt` (routing-accuracy runners/corpora, cost measurements, transcript/offer tests, legacy fidelity tests, the manual-testing playbook), plus shared docs that describe them.\\n- Behaviour claims to verify: routed command surfacing is cross-runtime correct (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh); a mutating command is never offered unsafely; holdout rows are never read by tune/fix/report paths; docs match runner behaviour; pass-one fixes hold.\\n- Reuse and conventions: append-gateway state recording, P0/P1/P2 severity ladder, three-artifact iteration contract, pass-one report as the fix baseline.\\n- Review risks and gaps: holdout prompt text is out of read scope (counts only); the worktree is dirty from concurrent lineages, so a live behaviour arm would refuse with `worktree_dirty` and runners are audited by reading; the coverage graph is unavailable, so search is lexical and direct-read.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | [pending] | - | - |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | [pending] | - | - |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | [pending] | - | - |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | [pending] | - | - |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | [pending] | - | - |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | [pending] | - | - |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| [accuracy-runner scope files] | - | - | - | pending |\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 7\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.10\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-accuracy-runner-2-1794570021136-noekp0, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-13T11:48:49Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794571186663,"end":1794571203083}}}}
