{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794571452576,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4cb3b6a001b972ZP0qVvI9Wf","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","messageID":"msg_1d4cb2f83001HaZPIZ8uhYtIbe","type":"tool","id":"call_f7f25322249542b396ca3b18","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- **`replayOffer` replaying the wrong hook for a non-Claude runtime.** Documented design: the head is the only text that names command and policy, and the replay is explicitly the Claude hook (`README.md:71`). Re-reporting it would be a deferred-item repeat, not a new defect.","oldString":"- **`replayOffer` replaying the wrong hook for a non-Claude runtime.** Documented design: the head is the only text that names command and policy, and the replay is explicitly the Claude hook (`README.md:64-66`). Re-reporting it would be a deferred-item repeat, not a new defect.","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/iterations/iteration-002.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/iterations/iteration-002.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/iterations/iteration-002.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/iterations/iteration-002.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/iterations/iteration-002.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/iterations/iteration-002.md\n@@ -87,9 +87,9 @@\n \n ## Ruled Out\n \n - **`parseOffer` reading a trailing word as part of the command.** Ruled out for the renderer's own head shape: after the command comes ` (policy)` or a space and a digit, and neither matches the optional second word. A two-word tracked command such as `/doctor:overlay apply` is matched whole, which is the intent.\n-- **`replayOffer` replaying the wrong hook for a non-Claude runtime.** Documented design: the head is the only text that names command and policy, and the replay is explicitly the Claude hook (`README.md:64-66`). Re-reporting it would be a deferred-item repeat, not a new defect.\n+- **`replayOffer` replaying the wrong hook for a non-Claude runtime.** Documented design: the head is the only text that names command and policy, and the replay is explicitly the Claude hook (`README.md:71`). Re-reporting it would be a deferred-item repeat, not a new defect.\n - **`backfillRunLog` writing a partial log.** Ruled out: every prompt is resolved before the first line is written.\n - **`measure-brief-cost.mjs` leaking a prompt.** Ruled out: output rows carry id and sizes only, and a refused row prints its id, never its prompt.\n \n ## Next Focus\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/iterations/iteration-002.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- **`replayOffer` replaying the wrong hook for a non-Claude runtime.** Documented design: the head is the only text that names command and policy, and the replay is explicitly the Claude hook (`README.md:71`). Re-reporting it would be a deferred-item repeat, not a new defect.\",\"oldString\":\"- **`replayOffer` replaying the wrong hook for a non-Claude runtime.** Documented design: the head is the only text that names command and policy, and the replay is explicitly the Claude hook (`README.md:64-66`). Re-reporting it would be a deferred-item repeat, not a new defect.\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/iterations/iteration-002.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794571451242,"end":1794571452576}}}}
