nd its deleted db dir is still referenced.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\"capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:31-33,354-377,662-668\",\"result\":\"env written and deleted, finally restores only Date and removes dbDir\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:361\",\"capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:662\"]}],\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"rationale\":\"The header claims a caller inherits no setup; the environment outlives the call.\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"iter2-P2-capture-env-not-restored\"},{\"id\":\"SL-104\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"targetRefs\":[\"runtime/scripts/measure-brief-cost.mjs\",\"runtime/lib/render.ts\"],\"bugClass\":\"ambient_environment\",\"hypothesis\":\"AI_SESSION_CHILD reaches the hook and changes the measured head.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\"measure-brief-cost.mjs:156-181; render.ts:533\",\"result\":\"env spreads process.env; renderer picks child session from the same variable\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"measure-brief-cost.mjs:167\",\"render.ts:533\"]}],\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"rationale\":\"A dispatched worker measures the downgraded brief and reports it as live.\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"iter2-P2-cost-script-child-brief\"},{\"id\":\"SL-105\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"targetRefs\":[\"runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\"],\"bugClass\":\"command_parse\",\"hypothesis\":\"parseOffer appends a following word to the command.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\"command-offer.mjs:34-67\",\"result\":\"optional second word exists, but renderer heads place a policy or a digit after the command\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"command-offer.mjs:34-67\",\"render.ts:603-609\"]}],\"disposition\":\"ruled_out\",\"rationale\":\"Not reachable from the renderer's own head shape.\",\"ruledOutReason\":\"renderer output never places a bare word after the command\"},{\"id\":\"SL-106\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"targetRefs\":[