{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794571978157,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4d342a00016ELCF8AkxfBgxW","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","messageID":"msg_1d4d30a020018cZJX7WLFPsZHl","type":"tool","id":"call_bacefbaef8724ef281485796","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2; grep -n \"## 8. WHAT WORKED\" -A9 deep-review-strategy.md; grep -n \"## 9. WHAT FAILED\" -A8 deep-review-strategy.md; grep -n \"P2 (Suggestions)\" deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"60:## 8. WHAT WORKED\n61-- Re-reading each fix at its cited line and then running the two guard files turned the fix replay into observed evidence instead of a doc comparison (iteration 1).\n62-- Counting the corpus and baseline by `id`, `split` and `row_type` proved holdout hygiene without ever printing prompt text (iteration 1).\n63-- Asking \"which caller reaches this line\" found the g2 `--row-id` arm defect: the selection code and `armFor` disagree only on a path neither file's comment covers (iteration 2).\n64-- Reading `finally` against every mutation the `try` makes found that only the clock and the temp directory are restored, not the environment (iteration 2).\n65-\n66----\n67-\n68-## 9. WHAT FAILED\n69-- The phase-map fix cannot be confirmed from the parent map: its reason sits only in `007/tasks.md`, so the pass-one item is reported again rather than closed (iteration 1).\n68:## 9. WHAT FAILED\n69-- The phase-map fix cannot be confirmed from the parent map: its reason sits only in `007/tasks.md`, so the pass-one item is reported again rather than closed (iteration 1).\n70-- An early suspicion that `parseOffer` swallows a trailing word failed the reach test: the renderer never prints a bare word after the command, so it stays ruled out rather than a finding (iteration 2).\n71-\n72----\n73-\n74-<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n75-## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n76-### **`backfillRunLog` writing a partial log.** Ruled out: every prompt is resolved before the first line is written. -- BLOCKED (iteration 2, 1 attempts)\n56:- P2 (Suggestions): 10\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"60:## 8. WHAT WORKED\n61-- Re-reading each fix at its cited line and then running the two guard files turned the fix replay into observed evidence instead of a doc comparison (iteration 1).\n62-- Counting the corpus and baseline by `id`, `split` and `row_type` proved holdout hygiene without ever printing prompt text (iteration 1).\n63-- Asking \"which caller reaches this line\" found the g2 `--row-id` arm defect: the selection code and `armFor` disagree only on a path neither file's comment covers (iteration 2).\n64-- Reading `finally` against every mutation the `try` makes found that only the clock and the temp directory are restored, not the environment (iteration 2).\n65-\n66----\n67-\n68-## 9. WHAT FAILED\n69-- The phase-map fix cannot be confirmed from the parent map: its reason sits only in `007/tasks.md`, so the pass-one item is reported again rather than closed (iteration 1).\n68:## 9. WHAT FAILED\n69-- The phase-map fix cannot be confirmed from the parent map: its reason sits only in `007/tasks.md`, so the pass-one item is reported again rather than closed (iteration 1).\n70-- An early suspicion that `parseOffer` swallows a trailing word failed the reach test: the renderer never prints a bare word after the command, so it stays ruled out rather than a finding (iteration 2).\n71-\n72----\n73-\n74-<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n75-## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n76-### **`backfillRunLog` writing a partial log.** Ruled out: every prompt is resolved before the first line is written. -- BLOCKED (iteration 2, 1 attempts)\n56:- P2 (Suggestions): 10\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2; grep -n \\\"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\\" -A9 deep-review-strategy.md; grep -n \\\"## 9. WHAT FAILED\\\" -A8 deep-review-strategy.md; grep -n \\\"P2 (Suggestions)\\\" deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794571977376,"end":1794571978157}}}}
