{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794571991826,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4d374f0001u712q32iB7aLC9","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","messageID":"msg_1d4d36939001hlQN0iM8wkhl7X","type":"tool","id":"call_fe51cc45db064c009bdec1ed","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- An early suspicion that `parseOffer` swallows a trailing word failed the reach test: the renderer never prints a bare word after the command, so it stays ruled out rather than a finding (iteration 2).\n- A first read of the playbook's \"41 `NNN-*.md`\" note looked like a missing-file report; the tree shows 50 differently named files, so the finding was narrowed to the note (iteration 4).","oldString":"- An early suspicion that `parseOffer` swallows a trailing word failed the reach test: the renderer never prints a bare word after the command, so it stays ruled out rather than a finding (iteration 2).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -69,8 +69,9 @@\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n - T