{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794572304453,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4d83d0d001RD71JpJSovzJqW","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","messageID":"msg_1d4d826bd0019ZPgWWDAey5YQV","type":"tool","id":"call_2a251e3d1f4343e2b1f164dc","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2; sed -n '22,30p' deep-review-strategy.md; grep -n \"COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\" -A6 deep-review-strategy.md; grep -n \"NEXT FOCUS\" -A4 deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n[All dimensions complete]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not reviewing `scorer-attach`, `render-hooks-plugin` or `doctor-install` area files except as read-only context when a cross-area contract is required\n- Not fixing anything: the review is observation-only\n46:## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n47-- [x] correctness\n48-- [x] security\n49-- [x] traceability\n50-- [x] maintainability\n51-\n52-<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n415:## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n416-- Dimension: synthesis - Focus area: compile the lineage report from the registry and the seven iteration files, then let the cross-lineage merge recompute the merged verdict - Reason: the cap is reached; no further iteration can change the active set without new evidence - Rotation status: all dimensions complete, stabilization and adjudication done - Blocked/productive carry-forward: blocked (no live arm, no graph); productive (fix replay, doc/tree comparison, restore probe) - Required evidence: the report's counts equal the registry's, and the final line is exactly one verdict Review verdict: PASS\n417-\n418-<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n419-## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n[All dimensions complete]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not reviewing `scorer-attach`, `render-hooks-plugin` or `doctor-install` area files except as read-only context when a cross-area contract is required\n- Not fixing anything: the review is observation-only\n46:## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n47-- [x] correctness\n48-- [x] security\n49-- [x] traceability\n50-- [x] maintainability\n51-\n52-<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n415:## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n416-- Dimension: synthesis - Focus area: compile the lineage report from the registry and the seven iteration files, then let the cross-lineage merge recompute the merged verdict - Reason: the cap is reached; no further iteration can change the active set without new evidence - Rotation status: all dimensions complete, stabilization and adjudication done - Blocked/productive carry-forward: blocked (no live arm, no graph); productive (fix replay, doc/tree comparison, restore probe) - Required evidence: the report's counts equal the registry's, and the final line is exactly one verdict Review verdict: PASS\n417-\n418-<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n419-## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2; sed -n '22,30p' deep-review-strategy.md; grep -n \\\"COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\\" -A6 deep-review-strategy.md; grep -n \\\"NEXT FOCUS\\\" -A4 deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794572303629,"end":1794572304453}}}}
