{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794572336876,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4d8b82a001SeKMWZCtlyuTY7","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a2200ffebIrmmKNfkMdQAD","messageID":"msg_1d4d8a1280012Ps3ndq9XLsK7s","type":"tool","id":"call_0766bb8ab71947b0afca3910","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Comparing each doc line with the tree or the function it names exposed two playbook statements and one test-table description that a green gate cannot catch (iteration 4).\n- A local `git init` probe turned the porcelain quoting question into an observed fact instead of a guess, which is what raised the restore finding from suspicion to evidence (iteration 5).\n- Replaying every active finding before the final iteration kept the terminal counts honest and closed the coverage map without a new finding (iteration 6-7).","oldString":"- Comparing each doc line with the tree or the function it names exposed two playbook statements and one test-table description that a green gate cannot catch (iteration 4).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -64,8 +64,10 @@\n - Asking \"which caller reaches this line\" found the g2 `--row-id` arm defect: the selection code and `armFor` disagree only on a path neither file's comment covers (iteration 2).\n - Reading `finally` against every mutation the `try` makes found that only the clock and the temp directory are restored, not the environment (iteration 2).\n - Re-deriving every spec floor from the committed baseline turned traceability into arithmetic, and all five floors held (iteration 4).\n - Comparing each doc line with the tree or the function it names exposed two playbook statements and one test-table description that a green gate cannot catch (iteration 4).\n+- A local `git init` probe turned the porcelain quoting question into an observed fact instead of a guess, which is what raised the restore finding from suspicion to evidence (iteration 5).\n+- Replaying every active finding before the final iteration kept the terminal counts honest and closed the coverage map without a new finding (iteration 6-7).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Comparing each doc line with the tree or the function it names exposed two playbook statements and one test-table description that a green gate cannot catch (iteration 4).\\n- A local `git init` probe turned the porcelain quoting question into an observed fact instead of a guess, which is what raised the restore finding from suspicion to evidence (iteration 5).\\n- Replaying every active finding before the final iteration kept the terminal counts honest and closed the coverage map without a new finding (iteration 6-7).\",\"oldString\":\"- Comparing each doc line with the tree or the function it names exposed two playbook statements and one test-table description that a green gate cannot catch (iteration 4).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794572335146,"end":1794572336876}}}}
